QuestGuidance.Register("en",210,{
[6689]="7006EB89\n1\tPut out straw fires (total: 8)\030Tend to wounded Kûr Anzar citizens (total: 6)\030Defeat All-seeing cultists (total: 12)\tPut out straw fires and rescue trapped citizens in Kûr Anzar.\n2\tMeet Mizâdi back at the tower of Kûr Anzar\tMeet Mizâdi back at the tower of Kûr Anzar.\n",
[6690]="70059A09\n1\tTalk to Fastrith Hawkfeast in Zul-mazal\tFastrith has come to Zul-mazal.\n2\tListen to the dwarves discuss the broken mosaic in Zul-mazal\tFastrith and the other dwarves stand in Zul-mazal, discussing the broken mosaic on the wall.\n3\tTalk to Imák in Zul-mazal\tBored by the discussion, Imák has called for you to speak with him. He believes danger is near.\n4\tReturn to Zul-mazal with Imák and ready the defence\tA hobgoblin prey-catcher has found the entrance to Zul-mazal, and before he was slain he alerted his band to your position. You and the dwarves must ready your defence!\n5\tTalk to Bori in Zul-mazal\tBori and the other dwarves prepare to defend Zul-mazal from the hobgoblin hunting-pack. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tRemain alert for any further threats to the dwarves\tYou and the dwarves have defended Zul-mazal from the hobgoblin hunting-party.\n",
[6691]="70000F0C\n1\tTalk to Palma Brownlock\tPalma Brownlock is waiting to speak with you on the hills outside Naerost. Palma has somehow convinced you to sneak into the ruins of Naerost to reacquire the sword Medhrod.\n2\tCollect Medhrod\tThe sword Medhrod is somewhere within the ruins of Naerost. The half-orcs that stole Medhrod are surely keeping the sword under close watch inside the ruins.\n3\tTalk to Palma Brownlock\tPalma Brownlock is on the slope outside the ruins of Naerost. Palma is eagerly awaiting your return with Medhrod.\n",
[6692]="70060FB4\n1\tFind the wrapped present in the west storage room\tDinodas believes the present is currently being kept in the back room at the end of the entrance hall.\n2\tHide behind the table before you are seen!\tSomeone is drawing near to your room. You'd better hide behind the table!\n3\tUse liedown\030Use faint\tSomeone is drawing near to your room. You'd better hide behind the table!\n4\tWait for Prisca to return to the sitting room\tYou must wait until it is safe to move without being observed.\n5\tFind the wrapped present in the west storage room\tDinodas believes the present is currently being kept in the back room at the end of the entrance hall.\n6\tEscape from 8 Honeymead Lane\tWith the present safely in your possession, you must now escape from 8 Honeymead Lane.\n7\tStash the present somewhere... and fast!\tYou have to stash the present somewhere before you are found with it!\n8\tHear what Angelica has to say\tAngelica is looking for you.\n9\tTalk to Angelica Boffin\tAngelica wants to talk to you.\n10\tTalk to Prisca Boffin\tPrisca wants to talk to you.\n11\tTalk to Angelica Boffin\tAngelica has more to say to you.\n12\tListen to Angelica and keep her from discovering any mischief!\tAngelica has more to say to you.\n13\tCheer in order to keep Angelica from finding Dinodas\tQuick! You must think of something to mask Dinodas's sounds of celebration!\n14\tTalk to Angelica Boffin\tDinodas has made it out of 8 Honeymead Lane with the wrapped present!\n",
[6693]="70001338\n1\tTalk to Jarl Copperbrace\tJarl Copperbrace is waiting for you outside Ost Galumar. Jarl Copperbrace wishes to speak with you.\n2\tHang standards of the Free Peoples on standard-poles (total: 3)\tThree standard-poles are positioned on the walls of Ost Galumar. Jarl Copperbrace has asked you to raise three of the standards of the Free Peoples over Ost Galumar.\n3\tTalk to Jarl Copperbrace\tJarl Copperbrace is outside Ost Galumar. Jarl Copperbrace is waiting to speak with you about your successful errand.\n",
[6694]="7006C74D\n1\tTalk to Girhâzi\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh. You should talk to her.\n2\tListen to the conversation\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n3\tWave at Khûldim Umûn\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n4\tListen to the conversation\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n5\tFlex at Khûldim Umûn\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n6\tListen to the conversation\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n7\tPose for Khûldim Umûn\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n8\tTalk to Girhâzi\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n9\tListen to the conversation\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n10\tChallenge Khûldim Umûn to trial by combat\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n11\tListen to Khûldim Umûn\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n12\tClap for Khûldim Umûn's decision\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n",
[6695]="70002DDB\n1\tTalk to Slade Ransford\tSlade Ransford is at Ost Cyrn, in the Lone-lands. Slade is waiting to speak with you about fighting deep into Ost Cyrn in search of Mosal-ruk, the vile Orc that leads this war-band.\n2\tTalk to Slade Ransford\tSlade Ransford is at Ost Cyrn, in the Lone-lands. Slade is taking a quick rest atop one of the ruined buildings of Ost Cyrn, and is waiting to speak with you about proceeding further into the ruins in search of Mosal-ruk.\n3\tDefy Mosal-ruk\tMosal-ruk stands defiantly before you. You have fought deep into Ost Cyrn with Slade Ransford, and the time has come to face Mosal-ruk, the leader of the war-band that occupies the ruins.\n4\tTalk to Slade Ransford\tSlade Ransford stands triumphantly within Ost Cyrn. Together, you and Slade journeyed into the ruins of Ost Cyrn and put an end to Mosal-ruk and his vile war-band.\n",
[6696]="7006C584\n1\tSpeak with Sigénik\tSigénik awaits you near the gate north of Jirush.\n2\tLook south along the road in the shadow of the gate\tMake your way to the gate and await the arrival of Bosóta Dôlo.\n3\tSpeak with the captain after the battle\tEnter the way-station and defeat Bosóta Dôlo and his escort. Engage them, defeat them, and then confront the captain.\n4\tSpeak with Sigénik north of the gate\tBosóta Dôlo yielded. You should return to Sigénik with the information he provided.\n",
[6697]="70043B45\n1\tTalk to Bingo on the road\tYou have come with Bingo a good distance into the Dimrill Dale, and a path leads to the east in the direction of the Golden Wood.\n2\tTalk to Bingo on the road through the Dimrill Dale\tYou defended Bingo from attack by an Orc raiding party, and now the hobbit is ready to continue his relaxing stroll through the Dimrill Dale.\n3\tTalk to Haldir on the road\tHaldir and a number of Elves have arrived at a fortuitous moment, and seem to have been expecting you.\n4\tTalk to Bingo on the road\tYou have come with Bingo through the Dimrill Dale and encountered a small party of Elves sent from Lothlórien to meet you.\n5\tTravel into Lothlórien with Haldir and Bingo\tHaldir has asked for you and Bingo to accompany him into Lothlórien.\n6\tTalk to Bingo inside Caras Galadhon\tYou and Bingo have been escorted into Lothlórien, and now the hobbit is very excited to learn as much about the Elves as he can.\n7\tListen to the words of Celeborn and Galadriel\tYou and Bingo have encountered Celeborn and Galadriel, and they are most interested to hear of your journeys.\n8\tTalk to Celeborn\030Talk to Galadriel\tThe Lord and Lady of Lórien wait to speak with you in Caras Galadhon.\n9\tTalk to Bingo in Caras Galadhon\tBingo is within Caras Galadhon, waiting to speak with you.\n",
[6698]="7005B253\n1\tTalk to Kyrstig\tKyrstig is ready to describe what she saw earlier. You should talk to Kyrstig.\n2\tListen to the conversation\tKyrstig is describing what she saw transpire between the Angmarim cultist and Loknashra. You should listen to the conversation.\n",
[6699]="700413B9\n1\tSpeak with Borhador\tBorhador heard sounds coming from outside the hall. You should speak with Borhador.\n2\tLeave Borhador and face whatever is pounding upon the walls of the Crossing-hall\tLeave Borhador and face whatever is pounding upon the walls of the Crossing-hall.\n3\tLet the events transpire\tLet the events transpire.\n4\tSpeak with Borhador\tBorhador stands outside the Crossing-hall. You should speak with Borhador.\n",
[6700]="7001B242\n1\tDefeat the Orcs pursuing Gollum\tSpeak with Miluimil and proceed into the caverns to stop the Orcs pursuing Gollum from capturing him.\n2\tTalk to Miluimil to depart from the dark caverns.\t\n",
[6701]="7002C053\n1\tTalk to Radagast the Brown\tBefore you sits Radagast the Brown, a Wizard of Gandalf's order. He is seeking your help in the War of the Ring. You should speak with Radagast and see how you can help. Right-click on characters to interact.\n",
[6702]="70058C85\n1\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Múta is ready to search for Brathar in Tûr Ágal. You should speak to her when you are prepared.\n2\tFollow Múta and fight your way through Tûr Ágal\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You should follow Múta into the heights of Tûr Ágal.\n3\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Múta has paused beside a door in the heights of Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.\n4\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have found Brathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown gathered in Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.\n5\tObserve the meeting between Brathar and the Iron Crown\tBrathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have found Brathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown gathered in Tûr Ágal. You should observe this meeting and try to remain unseen.\n6\tTalk to Brathar Crack-helm\tBrathar Crack-helm can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have been discovered by Brathar Crack-helm. You should approach Brathar and talk to him.\n7\tObserve Brathar's departure from Tûr Ágal\tBrathar Crack-helm is departing the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You should remain alert while Brathar and his Dourhands depart.\n8\tTalk to Bandrauth Adder-fang\tBandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have been offered to Bandrauth Adder-fang that he might atone for his failure. You should talk to Bandrauth Adder-fang.\n9\tDefeat Bandrauth Adder-fang\tBandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Bandrauth Adder-fang intends to slay you to atone for his failures in Elderslade. You should defend yourself and defeat Bandrauth Adder-fang.\n10\tDefeat Bandrauth Adder-fang and the Dourhands\tBandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Sensing that Bandrauth Adder-fang may fail in his task yet again, the Dourhands have entered the fight to ensure that you do not leave Tûr Ágal.\n11\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. With Múta's aid, you have overcome Bandrauth Adder-fang and the Dourhands at Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.\n",
[6703]="7004300B\n1\tTalk to Bingo on the slope leading down to Helegrod\tBingo is standing on the snowy slope that leads down to the dwarf-hold of Helegrod.\n2\tTalk to Spalvi on the slope above Helegrod\tSpalvi is on the snowy slope above Helegrod.\n3\tTalk to Spalvi\tYou have defeated a handful of Corcur nomads, but Spalvi said he does not recognize among their number the foes that ambushed him.\n4\tMake your way to the stairs that lead up to the gate to Helegrod\tA Corcur nomad camp lies between you and the great gate to Helegrod. Spalvi and Bingo will meet up with you once you reach the front stairs.\n5\tClimb the steps to Helegrod with Bingo\tBingo is slowly making his way up the stairs to the gate to Helegrod, and you should follow him.\n6\tTalk to Bingo at the top of the steps\tBingo stands outside the great gate to Helegrod, waiting to speak with you.\n7\tTalk to Spalvi at the top of the steps\tSpalvi has arrived at the top of the steps, in front of the great gate to Helegrod.\n8\tTalk to the leader of the Dourhand band\tA group of Dourhands have come to Helegrod, and their leader wishes to speak to you.\n9\tSurvive the confrontation with the Dourhands\tSpalvi has been revealed as a Dourhand, and now you are in a tricky situation.\n10\tTalk to Bingo\tBingo is being held by the Dourhands in exchange for your good behaviour.\n",
[6704]="70030D07\n1\tEscort the waggon along the road\tRunald and his family await you at the southern entrance to the village of Elthengels.\n2\tTalk to Runald\tRunald and his family have arrived safely at the trader's outpost along the road. Runald wishes to thank you for aiding his departure.\n",
[6705]="7002CDEB\n1\tFree Stanric from his bonds\tStanric is in the lock-house.\n2\tTalk to Stanric\tStanric is in the prison of Stangard.\n3\tHelp Stanric out of his cell\tStanric is in the prison of Stangard.\n4\tListen to Stanric's plan\tStanric is in the lock-house of Stangard.\n5\tRally the men in the inn\tThe inn in Stangard is full of suspicious Rohirrim.\n6\tTell Athulf of Sithric's deception\tAthulf is in the tavern of Stangard with some equally suspicious men.\n7\tTalk to Stanric\tStanric is now in the Mead Hall of Stangard.\n8\tHelp Stanric take down Sithric once and for all\tDefend Stanric and defeat Sithric.\n9\tTalk to Stanric\tStanric is in the Mead Hall.\n",
[6706]="7006EB94\n1\tSpeak with Razâl inside the Angar Aragín\tSpeak with Razâl inside the Angar Aragín.\n2\tGo with Razâl up the tower stairs to find Numûru\030Folllow Razâl and defeat All-seeing cultists (total: 8)\tGo with Razâl up the tower stairs to find Numûru and defeat All-seeing cultists. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tFree Numûru from his bonds\tFree Numûru from his bonds.\n4\tSpeak with Numûru in the Angar Aragín\tSpeak with Numûru in the Angar Aragín.\n5\tSpeak with Razâl\tSpeak with Razâl in the Angar Aragín.\n6\tAscend the stairs and defeat the Barkhûshim (total: 5)\tAscend the stairs and defeat the Barkhûshim guarding the other prisoners.\n7\tFind the other prisoners\tFind the other prisoners.\n8\tFree the first prisoner\030Free the second prisoner\030Free the third prisoner\tFree the prisoners.\n9\tDefeat Karâshna Zíri\tDefeat Karâshna Zíri.\n",
[6707]="70040433\n1\tTalk to Gúrion\tGúrion is standing near the base of the Hill of Erech. You have arrived at the Hill of Erech and should now speak to Gúrion.\n2\tFollow Gúrion up the Hill of Erech\tGúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech. You should follow Gúrion toward the summit of the Hill of Erech.\n3\tFollow Gúrion further up the Hill of Erech\tGúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech. You have defeated the Dead that attacked you, and should continue up the hill.\n4\tFollow Gúrion to the Hill's peak\tGúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech. You have defeated the Dead again, but should now sprint to the Hill's peak in hopes of avoiding continued attacks by the Dead.\n5\tTalk to Gúrion\tGúrion is hiding near the peak of the Hill of Erech. You have reached a point close to the summit, and should now speak to Gúrion.\n6\tTalk to Nerzus\tNerzus is standing at the Stone of Erech. You have followed Gúrion to the Hill's peak, and should now attempt to convince Nerzus and the Ruthless Dead of the invader's deception.\n7\tObserve the meeting of the Dead and Azruthor\tAzruthor and Nerzus are at the Stone of Erech. You should watch the meeting between the invader and the Dead.\n8\tDefeat Nerzus\tNerzus is at the Stone of Erech. You should defeat him before warning the people of Blackroot Vale of Azruthor's summoning of the Dead to Tarlang's Crown.\n9\tTalk to Gúrion\tGúrion is at the peak of the Hill of Erech. You have defeated Nerzus once more, but many of the Dead have rallied to Azruthor's side in Tarlang's Crown.\n",
[6708]="7001792E\n1\tTalk to Andyri\tAndyri is waiting to speak with you inside the Stone-troll caves.\n2\tDefend the Elves until they have recovered their strength\tYou must prevent the Elves from being defeated while they rest from their battles.\n3\tTalk to Andyri\tAndyri is in the Stone-troll cave. You have protected Andyri's Elves while they recovered and should now speak with her.\n",
[6709]="70035CBD\n1\tSpeak with Gárwig\tGárwig is in the Mead Hall of Forlaw. You should speak with Gárwig.\n2\tFollow Gárwig and speak with him\tAssist Gárwig in Forlaw.\n3\tAssist Gárwig in Forlaw\tAssist Gárwig in Forlaw.\n4\tHelp Gárwig\tSpeak with Gárwig at the gate.\n",
[6710]="7004942D\n1\tApproach Galadriel\tYou should approach Galadriel.\n2\tTalk to Galadriel\tGaladriel has stepped up to her Mirror and looks ready to gaze into it.\n3\tHear what the Mirror shows\tGaladriel is gazing into her Mirror. Stand by her and she will relate all that she sees.\n4\tTalk to Galadriel\tGaladriel seems to have seen all that she will see in the Mirror, tonight, and is ready to talk with you.\n",
[6711]="700169ED\n1\tAttend the final council\tAttend the final council.\n2\tTalk to Glorfindel\tSpeak with Glorfindel to return to Rivendell.\n",
[6712]="7005A7FC\n1\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm. After Azog's defeat and the routing of the Orcs at Azanulbizar, King Thráin has returned to the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to King Thráin.\n2\tFollow King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\n3\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm. With the head of Azog prepared, King Thráin intends to send a warning to the Orcs of Moria. You should talk to King Thráin.\n4\tWitness as King Thráin places Azog's head upon a stake at Khazad-dûm\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\n5\tTalk to Nár\tNár can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm. After King Thráin set Azog's head upon a stake, Nár has arrived at the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to Nár.\n6\tWitness as Nár inspects the head of Azog\tNár can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\n7\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm. After witnessing Nár return the coin-purse to Azog, King Thráin has beckoned you over. You should talk to King Thráin.\n8\tRest at Durin's Stone\tYou should rest with King Thráin and the surviving Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ at Durin's Stone.\n9\tListen to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses\030Join the gathering of survivors at Durin's Stone\tSurviving Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ have gathered at Durin's Stone. After a night of fitful rest, you have awoken to find the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ gathered at Durin's Stone. You should join the gathering of survivors there.\n10\tListen to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses\tThe Kings of the Seven Houses have gathered at Durin's Stone. On the morn after the Battle of Azanulbizar, the Kings of the Seven Houses have again gathered to council. You should listen to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses.\n11\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. After the other lords and Kings of the Seven Houses have expressed apprehension about continuing the war, King Thráin and the other dwarves have looked to Dáin. You should speak with him now.\n12\tListen to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. Dáin has been forced to rebuke King Thráin with a tale of the aftermath of Azog's slaying. You should listen to Dáin.\n13\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found in the First Hall of Khazad-dûm. Dáin is recounting his tale of entering the First Hall of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to Dáin.\n14\tListen to Dáin's tale\tDáin is recounting the tale of what he saw in the First Hall of Khazad-dûm.\n15\tUrge the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ to remain calm\tThe Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ can be found at Durin's Stone. After Dáin revealed that he encountered Durin's Bane, the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ have grown uneasy. You should calm them down.\n16\tListen to King Thráin and Thorin\tKing Thráin and Thorin can be found at Durin's Stone. King Thráin has asked Thorin what he believes should be done at Azanulbizar. You should listen to King Thráin and Thorin.\n17\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone. After Thorin gave his counsel, King Thráin and the other Kings of the Seven Houses have agreed to the war's ending. You should talk to King Thráin.\n18\tAid the Haban'akkâ\tKing Thráin has set the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ on a grim task. You should aid the Haban'akkâ.\n19\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. After the felling of trees and the raising of great pyres at Azanulbizar, the time has come to burn the fallen Kings and their guards at Durin's Stone.\n20\tPay your respects to King Shâlim and the Abnúzhu\030Pay your respects to King Ugún and the Kámbrada\030Pay your respects to King Onúr and the Landorrim\030Pay your respects to King Drógar and the Narfanghoth\030Pay your respects to King Jegín and the Temámir\030Pay your respects to King Vékun and the Zhélruka\tThe Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, Temámir, Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu can be found at Durin's Stone. Before the final pyres are lit at Durin's Stone, Dáin has suggested that you pay your respects to the Kings of the Seven Houses. Afterward, Dáin has asked you to talk to Thorin.\n21\tTalk to Thorin\tThorin can be found at Durin's Stone. You have paid your respects to the other dwarf-kings. You should talk to Thorin at the central pyre at Durin's Stone.\n22\tFind King Thráin at Kheled-zâram\tKing Thráin might be found by the banks of Kheled-zâram. After preparing the final pyres at Azanulbizar, Thorin has asked you to find King Thráin.\n23\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found by the banks of Kheled-zâram near Durin's Stone. You have found King Thráin at the banks of Kheled-zâram. Speak with him.\n24\tTalk to Thorin\tThorin can be found at Durin's Stone. After finding King Thráin lost in thought beside Kheled-zâram, he told you to return to Thorin and let his son know that he would soon return. You should talk to Thorin.\n25\tWait for King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone. King Thráin has returned to Durin's Stone. You should wait for King Thráin to give the order to light the final pyres.\n26\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone. You should talk to King Thráin.\n27\tAid King Thráin and light the pyres at Durin's Stone\tThe pyres can be found at Durin's Stone. King Thráin has asked you to join him in lighting the final pyres at Durin's Stone.\n28\tWitness the lighting of the pyres at Durin's Stone\tThe pyres can be found at Durin's Stone.\n29\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. After the lighting of the final pyres, the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs has come to an end. You should talk to Dáin.\n",
[6713]="700451B4\n1\tTalk to Corunir\tYou have come with Corunir to an outpost on the Pelennor where the fighting has been thick.\n2\tFind Golodir\tGolodir has gone ahead. Can you find him before it is too late?\n3\tTalk to Golodir\tGolodir felled the mighty Thrúgrath, but his body is broken and he will not survive.\n4\tTalk to Corunir\tCorunir mourns the loss of his friend on the Pelennor.\n",
[6714]="70015AD5\n1\tDefeat Wing-drake hatchlings ([see journal]/20)\030Defeat Wing-drake yearlings ([see journal]/10)\tHunt down the younger drakes while avoiding their elder brethren.\n2\tDefeat Rimlúg the Wing-mother\tThe enraged Wing-mother has descended into the courtyard in the centre of the ruins. Confront and defeat her to drive the drakes from the ruins for good.\n3\tUse the ancient anvil\030Collect Infused Garnet\tUse the ancient forge to empower your imbued garnet.\n4\tTalk to Perimbant\tSpeak with Perimbant to return to Echad Dúnann.\n",
[6715]="70009EAF\n1\tDeliver the formal complaint\tHob Hillbrow has asked you to confront Will Tuffin, the leader of the Big Folk in Dwaling, with his letter.\n",
[6716]="7002EB1A\n1\tGet the bat from Heburga\tThe children of Langhold are at the farm near the town.\n2\tUse the bat to whomp the \"brigands\" (total: 15)\tUse the bat to whomp the \"brigands\" at the farm.\n3\tTalk to Heburga and see if she concedes\tYou should talk to Heburga to see if she concedes.\n4\tAppease the children by letting them play Rohirrim, and beat you into submission\tThe children are now the Rohirrim, and you're the brigand. You should let the children beat you up.\n5\tTalk to the rider who hailed you\tYou should speak with the rider who hailed you.\n",
[6717]="70071BCA\n1\tTalk to Gôbezhir\tYou have joined Gôbezhir to present the axe he made to Mêshaget. You should talk to Gôbezhir.\n2\tWatch Gôbezhir present the weapon to Mêshaget\tYou have joined Gôbezhir to present the axe he made to Mêshaget. You watch Gôbezhir give the weapon to its recipient.\n3\tDefeat the roc huntress\tAs you watched Gôbezhir give the weapon to Mêshaget, your company was attacked by a roc huntress. You should defeat the roc attacking you.\n4\tTalk to Mêshaget\tAs you watched Gôbezhir give the weapon to Mêshaget, your company was attacked by a roc huntress. Together, you and Mêshaget defeated the aggressive avian. You should talk to Mêshaget.\n",
[6718]="70000DF5\n1\tSpeak to Ulfar\tSpeak to Ulfar and then defend him as he delves deeper into the dwarf camp.\n2\tSpeak to Ulfar\tUlfar has been wounded in the battle. Speak to him to see what he would have you do.\n3\tSlay the Stone-troll\tUlfar has told you to continue on, deeper into the dwarf camp, without him and slay the Stone-troll, if you find one. Ulfar was wounded in the fighting and was unable to continue on with you. He told you though that the Stone-troll must be slain, and to be on the watch for Olwir, as he will surely try to stop you from slaying the beast.\n4\tSpeak to Ulfar\tWith the Stone-troll and Olwir dead, return to the wounded Ulfar and tell him what happened.\n",
[6719]="7006EEE3\n1\tEnter Amalíbi's encampment near Iridír\tEnter Amalíbi's encampment near Iridír.\n2\tListen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation.\n3\tSpeak with Zagêli in Amalíbi's camp\030Speak with Gúrumkir in Amalíbi's camp\030Speak with Jínsa in Amalíbi's camp\tSpeak with several of the wounded soldiers in Amalíbi's camp and ask if they require aid.\n4\tGather fresh bandages for Zagêli\030Find a bottle of Khôrob for Gúrumkir\tHelp Amalíbi's wounded with their various needs.\n5\tGive the fresh bandages to Zagêli\030Give the bottle of Khôrob for Gúrumkir\030Ask to hear Jínsa's story\030Listen to Jínsa's story\tGive the fresh bandages to Zagêli and the Khôrob to Gúrumkir in Amalíbi's camp.\n6\tComfort Jínsa in Amalíbi's encampment\tComfort Jínsa in Amalíbi's encampment.\n7\tLet Mizâdi know you have helped the wounded\tLet Mizâdi know you have helped the wounded.\n8\tListen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation.\n9\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Amalíbi's camp\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Amalíbi's camp.\n",
[6720]="7006B70C\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir in front of the waterfall\tMithrandir and your companions prepare to confront the Thardúth.\n2\tConfront Azagath in front of Utug-bûr\tServants of the Thardúth await you at Utug-bûr.\n3\tTalk to Rothog\030Talk to Khôltekh\tAzagath Sea-shadow has suggested that his former allies among the Kindred of the Coins join his new cause.\n4\tRemain on guard during the confrontation with Azagath\tYour companions stand opposed to Azagath Sea-shadow and the Thardúth he now serves.\n5\tRemain on guard during the confrontation with Azagath\tYour companions stand opposed to Azagath Sea-shadow and the Thardúth he now serves.\n",
})
